<p class="govuk-body">If you are not allowed to contact a person or people, contact includes:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>meeting them in person</li>
  <li>calling, texting or sending a letter to them</li>
  <li>sending a message or following them on social media</li>
  <li>asking someone else to pass a message to them</li>
  <li>trying to find out information about them from other people</li>
  <li>maintaining a friendship or a relationship with them</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">If they get in touch with you first, do not reply. If this happens, tell <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_contact_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a>.</p>
